 "ほか": "خَارِج, بره (The part of something that faces out; the outer surface.) / خَارِج (Outdoors.) / خَارِج (On the outside of, not inside (something, such as a building).)  [outside]\nمثال: 彼はほかに情報を求めることにした。\n→ He decided to seek information elsewhere. / آخَر, إِضَافِيّ (One more further, in addition to the quantity by then; a second or additional on) / آخَر, أُخْرَى (Not the same; different.)  [another (person or thing)]\nمثال: 地球は水があるという点でほかの惑星と違う。\n→ The earth is different from the other planets in that it has water. / أَبْعَد (Further away than.) / أَقْصَى (On the far side of.) / بَعْد (Later than; after.) / فَوْق (Greater than; so as to exceed or surpass.) / فَوْقَ (In addition to; supplementing.)  [beyond (one's expectations, imagination, etc.)]\nesp. 外 / اِسْتَثْنَى (To exclude; to specify as being an exception.) / إِلَّا, بِاسْتِثْنَاء (Used to introduce an exception or qualification to something previously stated.) / إِلَّا (Used to introduce a clause, phrase, verb infinitive, adverb or other non-noun co)  [except]\nwith neg. sentence; as ...ほかに...ない, ...するほかない, etc.\nمثال: ここには私のほかに誰もいない。\n→ There's no one but me here.",
