 "ほこさき": "رأس حربة (The pointed head, or end, of a spear.)  [spearhead] / بُؤْرَة (Concentration of attention.)  [focus (of one's attack, criticism, etc.)] / قُوَّة (Ability to influence; strength or energy of body or mind; active power; vigour; ) / قُوَّة (Anything that is able to make a substantial change in a person or thing.) / أَجْبَرَ, اِضْطَرَّ (To compel (an adversary or partner) to trump a trick by leading a suit that he/s)  [force (of an argument)]",
