 "ほこらしい": "فَخُور (gratified, feeling honoured, feeling satisfied)  [proud]\nمثال: 彼女の顔は誇らしさで赤く上気していた。\n→ She was aflame with pride.",
 "ほこらしげ": "فَخُور (gratified, feeling honoured, feeling satisfied)  [proud]\nمثال: 彼は帰宅するやいなや、誇らしげに衝撃の発表をした。\n→ No sooner had he come home than he proudly made an earth-shattering announcement.",
