 "ほころばす": "مَزَّقَ, شَقَّ (To rend (a solid material) by holding or restraining in two places and pulling a) / خَرْق, شَقّ (A hole or break caused by tearing.) / دَمْع, دَمْعَة (A drop of clear, salty liquid produced from the eyes by crying or irritation.) / دَمَعَ (To produce tears.)  [to tear]",
 "ほころばせる": "[to break into a smile] / [to tear open ; to tear apart] / مَفْتُوح (Able to be used or interacted with in some way.) / فَتَحَ (to make something accessible) / فتح (to make something accessible) / حل (to make something accessible) / فتح (to make something accessible) / اِنْفَتَحَ (to become open)  [to open]",
 "ほころび": "مَزَّقَ, شَقَّ (To rend (a solid material) by holding or restraining in two places and pulling a) / خَرْق, شَقّ (A hole or break caused by tearing.) / دَمْع, دَمْعَة (A drop of clear, salty liquid produced from the eyes by crying or irritation.) / دَمَعَ (To produce tears.)  [tear]\nمثال: シャツのほころびも直した。\n→ I mended my torn shirt, too.",
