 "ほこをまじえる": "عَارَكَ, قَاتَلَ (Senses relating to physical conflict:) / تَعَارَكَ, تَقَاتَلَ (Senses relating to physical conflict:) / نَاضَلَ, كَافَحَ (To strive for something; to campaign or contend for success.) / قِتَال (An occasion of fighting.) / مَعْرَكَة (A battle between opposing armies.)  [to fight]",
 "ほご": "حِمَايَة (The process of keeping (something or someone) safe.)  [protection]\nمثال: その子はおじの保護を受けている。\n→ He is in custody of his uncle. / مُحَافَظَة (The act of preserving; care to preserve; act of keeping from destruction, decay )  [preservation]\nمثال: 人類が環境を保護しなければ環境から人類は締め出されるだろう。\n→ If mankind doesn't take care of the environment, the environment may eliminate mankind.",
