 "ほごく": "اِحْتِيَاط (that which is reserved or kept back, as for future use) / ذَخِيرَة (that which is reserved or kept back, as for future use) / حَجَزَ (To book in advance; to make a reservation for.)  [reserve (for wild animals)]\nمثال: けがを治療してもらったトラは、村人たちの手で無事、保護区に帰された。\n→ The tiger, having had its wounds treated, was returned by the villagers to the animal sanctuary without incident.",
 "ほごこく": "الحِمَايَة (Government by a protector; especially, The Protectorate: government of England, )  [protectorate]",
