 "ほごせいさく": "حِمَائِيَّة (A system or policy of protecting the domestic producers of a product from foreig)  [protectionism]",
 "ほごにする": "خُرْدَة (Discarded objects (especially metal) that may be dismantled to recover their con) / يتخلى, نبذ (To discard; to get rid of.) / شجار (to fight)  [to scrap]\nمثال: 一族が苦労して積み上げてきたものを、お前は一瞬で反故にするつもりか。\n→ Do you intend to throw away in one instant what our family has painstakingly built up? / [to make null and void ; to renege]",
