 "ほしい": "أَرَادَ, رَغِبَ (To desire (to experience desire); to wish.)  [wanting (to have)]\nمثال: 私は鉛筆をけずるナイフがほしい。\n→ I want a knife to sharpen my pencil with. / [I want (you, them, etc.) to (do)]\nafter the -te form of a verb\nمثال: この書類をそれぞれ２部ずつコピーしてほしいんだが。\n→ I'd like two copies of each of these documents.",
