 "ほす": "هَوَاء (The substance constituting Earth's atmosphere: a gaseous mixture of nitrogen, ox) / جَوّ (The apparently open space above the ground which this substance fills, (historic) / نَغَم (A melody or song, especially a solo; an aria.)  [to air]\nمثال: この座布団を干して下さい。\n→ Please air the zabuton. / بَالُوعَة (An access point or conduit for rainwater that drains directly downstream in a (d)  [to drain (off)] / [to drink up] / [to deprive of a role, job, etc.]\nusu. in the passive\nمثال: なんで途中から突然干されるようになってしまったんだろうか。\n→ I wonder why he was suddenly dropped from the team half way through.",
