 "まけないくらい": "قَدْر اَلْمُسْتَطَاع, قَدْر اَلْإِمْكَان (As much as is possible.)  [as much as possible]",
 "まけないぐらい": "قَدْر اَلْمُسْتَطَاع, قَدْر اَلْإِمْكَان (As much as is possible.)  [as much as possible]",
 "まける": "فَقَدَ (To cease to have (something) in one's possession or capability.) / خَسِرَ (To become a defeated competitor in (a game, competition, trial, etc).) / خَسِرَ (To be defeated (in a game, competition, contest, etc.))  [to lose]\nocc. written as 敗ける\nمثال: ３対０で彼には負けています。\n→ He's beating me, three to zip. / أَذْعَنَ (To relent, yield, surrender or admit defeat.)  [to give in (to)] / [to be inferior (to) ; to be second (to)] / [to get a rash (from) ; to come out in a rash]",
