 "まげる": "ثَنَى (to cause to shape into a curve)  [to bend]\nمثال: 少年は考えを曲げなかった。\n→ The boy persisted in his opinion. / مَالَ (To incline, deviate, or bend, from a vertical position; to be in a position thus) / اِسْتَنَدَ, اِتَّكَأَ (To rest or rely, for support, comfort, to use as a hard surface for writing, etc)  [to lean] / ثَنَى (to cause to shape into a curve)  [to bend (the truth)] / أَجْزَأَ (to give as required) / أَجْزَى (to give as required) / أَدَرَّ (to give as required) / أَغَلَّ (to give as required) / أَكْسَبَ (to give as required) / أَمَّنَ (to give as required) / إِفَادَة (quantity of something produced) / إِفَادَةٌ مِنْ (quantity of something produced) / إِنْتاج (quantity of something produced) / إِيراد (quantity of something produced) / اِسْتِفَادَة (quantity of something produced) / جَدَاء (quantity of something produced)  [to yield (a point)]",
 "まこころ": "إِخْلَاص (The quality or state of being sincere.)  [sincerity]\nمثال: 彼女は彼に真心こめて感謝しました。\n→ She thanked him with all her heart.",
 "まこと": "حَقِيقَة (True facts, genuine depiction or statements of reality.) / حَقِيقَة (Conformity to fact or reality; correctness, accuracy.) / حَقِيقَة (The state or quality of being true to someone or something.) / حَقِيقَة (That which is real, in a deeper sense; spiritual or ‘genuine’ reality.)  [truth]\nمثال: 嘘から出た誠。\n→ Many a true word is spoken in jest. / إِخْلَاص (The quality or state of being sincere.)  [sincerity]\nمثال: 手八丁口八丁の彼だけど、誠がないのが玉に瑕だね。\n→ He works fast and is very articulate but his insincerity is his biggest defect. / حَقًّا (Actually; in fact; in reality.) / وَٱللّٰه؟ (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / لَيْسَ مَعْقُل! (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / حَقًّا (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some )  [really]",
 "まことに": "حَقًّا (Actually; in fact; in reality.) / وَٱللّٰه؟ (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / لَيْسَ مَعْقُل! (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / حَقًّا (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some )  [really]\nمثال: 遅れまして、誠に申し訳ありません。\n→ I'm awfully sorry that I was late.",
