 "まごまご": "اِحْتَارَ (unable to think clearly or understand) / تَشَوَّش (disoriented) / اِرْتَبَكَ, تَشَوَّش (chaotic, jumbled or muddled)  [confused]",
 "まごむすこ": "حَفِيد (A son of one's child.)  [grandson]",
 "まごむすめ": "حَفِيدَة (The daughter of someone's child.)  [granddaughter]\nمثال: 「ここだわ。ちょうどここがいい」と孫娘はいいました。\n→ \"There,\" said the granddaughter, \"that's just the place.\"",
