 "まさか": "أَبَدًا (Certainly not; definitely not; not at all.)  [by no means]\nمثال: まさかもう彼が来たのではないでしょうね。\n→ He hasn't come already, has he? / بِالتَّأْكِيد (In a way which is certain; with certainty.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (Without doubt, surely.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (An emphatic affirmative answer; of course.)  [certainly (not)]\nwith neg. verb / طَوَارِئ, حَالَةْ اَلطَّوَارِئ (A situation which poses an immediate risk and which requires urgent attention.)  [emergency] / حَقًّا (Actually; in fact; in reality.) / وَٱللّٰه؟ (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / لَيْسَ مَعْقُل! (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / حَقًّا (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some )  [really]",
 "まさき": "رَئِيس, رَئِيسَة (The part of the body of an animal or human which contains the brain, mouth, and ) / رَئِيس (A leader or expert.) / اِتَّجَهَ (To move in a specified direction.)  [the head]",
 "まさご": "رَمْل (finely ground rock)  [sand] / [capelin roe (used as a sushi topping)]",
 "まさしく": "بِالتَّأْكِيد (In a way which is certain; with certainty.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (Without doubt, surely.) / بِالتَّأْكِيد, بِدُون شَكّ (An emphatic affirmative answer; of course.)  [certainly]\nمثال: 彼女はまさしく支払わされたのだ。\n→ She was jolly well made to pay. / عَدْل (Morally right; upright, righteous, equitable; fair.) / فَقَط (only, simply, merely)  [just]",
 "まさつ": "اِحْتِكَاك (The rubbing of one object or surface against another.)  [friction]\nمثال: タイヤはゴムと路面の摩擦によってすり減る。\n→ Tires wear down because of friction between the rubber and the road surface. / [rubbing ; chafing] / اِحْتِكَاك (The rubbing of one object or surface against another.)  [friction]\nمثال: 米国人とイギリス人との間の摩擦が高まった。\n→ Friction between the Americans and the British mounted.",
 "まさつおん": "اِحْتِكَاكِي, رَخْو (Any of several speech sounds produced by air flowing through a constriction in t) / رَخْو (produced by air flowing through a restriction in the oral cavity.)  [fricative]",
