 "まさつけいすう": "معامل الاحتكاك (The ratio between (1) the magnitude of the force of friction which a surface pro)  [coefficient of friction]",
 "まさに": "بِالضَّبْط, تَمَامًا (Without approximation; precisely.) / بِالْضَبْط (Signifies agreement or recognition.)  [exactly]\nمثال: ＤＴＰで本を作れば、安いし早いし、まさに一挙両得だ。\n→ Desktop publishing lets you produce books quickly and cheaply. It's like killing two birds with one stone. / يَمِين, يمين (Clockwise, particularly when describing a change in direction or orientation.) / صَحِيح, صَوَاب (Complying with justice, correctness, or reason; correct, just, true. See also th) / قَائِم (Of an angle, measuring 90 degrees, or one quarter of a complete rotation; the an) / عَلَى اَلْيَمِين (On the right side.) / إِلَى اَلْيَمِين (Towards the right side.) / صحيح, تمام (Yes, that is correct; I agree.) / حَقّ, حُقُوق (A legal, just or moral entitlement.) / يَمِين (A wave breaking from right to left (viewed from the shore).) / صَحَّحَ (To correct.)  [right (when)]\nمثال: あなたの電話が鳴ったときまさに出かけようとするところだった。\n→ I was about to leave when you telephoned. / عَدْل (Morally right; upright, righteous, equitable; fair.) / فَقَط (only, simply, merely)  [just (about to)]\nalso written as 将に / حَقًّا (Actually; in fact; in reality.) / وَٱللّٰه؟ (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / لَيْسَ مَعْقُل! (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / حَقًّا (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some )  [really (ought to)]\nas まさに...べき; also written as 当に",
 "まさむね": "[famous sword ; sword blade by Masamune] / غاية, غَرَض (Cause, interest or account.)  [sake]",
 "まさる": "تَفَوَّقَ, بَزَّ (To surpass someone or something; to be better or do better than someone or somet) / بَرَعَ (To be much better than others.)  [to excel]\nمثال: 睡眠は薬に勝る。\n→ Sleep is better than medicine. / ثَقَلَ (To exceed in weight or mass.)  [to outweigh]",
 "まざい": "مَشْرُوب الطَّاقَة (A highly caffeinated, sometimes carbonated, beverage containing added ingredient)  [energy drink (esp. Monster Energy)]",
 "まざりあう": "خَلَط (To mix, to blend.)  [to commingle]",
 "まし": "أَفْضَل, أَحْسَن (comparative degree of good and well) / حَسَّنَ (To improve.) / تَحَسَّنَ (To become better; to improve.)  [better]\nesp. マシ\nمثال: 彼女は会社の床掃除よりましな仕事を望んだ。\n→ She wanted a better job than cleaning office floors. / أَكْثَر (comparative degree of many: in greater number. (Used for a discrete quantity.)) / أَكْثَر (comparative degree of much: in greater quantity, amount, or proportion. (Used fo) / أَكْثَر (comparative of much)  [more]\nمثال: 非会員は50ドル増しとなります。\n→ Non-members pay an additional 50 dollars. / زَاد (To make (a quantity, etc.) larger.) / زِيَادَة (An amount by which a quantity is increased.) / اِرْتِفَاع, اِزْدِيَاد (For a quantity, the act or process of becoming larger.)  [increase]",
 "ましかく": "مُرَبَّع (A polygon with four straight sides of equal length and four right angles; an equ) / مُرَبَّع (Shaped like a square (the polygon).) / مُرَبَّع (Used in the names of units of area formed by multiplying a unit of length by its)  [square]",
 "ましこ": "جَزَم, تُنْجِيّ (Any of the birds in the genus Carpodacus of the finch family.)  [rosefinch (any finch of genus Carpodacus)] / سَعْدَان, قِرْد (Any simian primate other than hominids; any monkey or ape.)  [monkey]",
 "ましこどり": "جَزَم, تُنْجِيّ (Any of the birds in the genus Carpodacus of the finch family.)  [rosefinch]",
 "ましじめ": "تَضْيِيق (The act or process of making more tight.)  [tightening (bolt, nut, etc.)]",
 "まして": "نَاهِيكَ عَن, هٰذَا عَدَا عَنْ (An apophasis used by a speaker to introduce, despite claiming not to address, a )  [not to mention]\nمثال: それらの星は肉眼で見える、まして望遠鏡ならなおさらである。\n→ You can see the stars with your naked eye, and even better through a telescope. / [still less]\nwith neg. verb\nمثال: メアリーはフランス語を読むことさえできない、まして話すことはできない。\n→ Mary can't even read French, much less speak it.",
