 "まじか": "قَرِيب (Physically close.) / قَرِيبًا (At or towards a position close in space or time.) / بِٱلْقُرْب مِنَ, عِنْدَ (Physically close to, in close proximity to.) / قَرُبَ (To come closer to; to approach.)  [near] / قَرِيب (Physically close.) / قَرِيبًا (At or towards a position close in space or time.) / بِٱلْقُرْب مِنَ, عِنْدَ (Physically close to, in close proximity to.) / قَرُبَ (To come closer to; to approach.)  [(drawing) near]\nمثال: この建物は完成間近だ。\n→ This building is near completion.",
