 "またあした": "أَرَاكَ غَدًا (Used as a farewell, stating that the speaker and interlocutor(s) will see each o)  [see you tomorrow]\nمثال: それじゃまた明日。\n→ See you tomorrow.",
 "またい": "اِنْتَهَى, أَكْمَلَ (To finish; to make done; to reach the end.) / كَامِل (With all parts included; with nothing missing; full.) / ذَرِيع (Generic intensifier.)  [complete] / أَمِين, سَالِم (Not in danger; out of harm's reach.) / خَزْنَة حَدِيدِيَّة, خَزْنَة (A box, usually made of metal, in which valuables can be locked for safekeeping.)  [safe]",
 "またがみ": "خَصْر, وَسَط (The part of the body between the pelvis and the stomach.)  [waist (the part of the pants located above the crotch)]",
 "またがる": "رَكِبَ (To place oneself on (a horse, a bicycle, etc.); to bestride.)  [to mount (a horse, bicycle, etc.)]\nمثال: 馬の背にまたがり野山を走り回った。\n→ I rode all over the countryside on horseback. / شِبْر (Any of various traditional units of length approximating this distance, especial)  [to span (an area, time, etc.)]\nمثال: 台風の被害は数県にまたがっていた。\n→ The damage of the typhoon spread over several prefectures.",
