 "またぞろ": "مَرَّة أُخْرَى (Another time: indicating a repeat of an action.)  [(yet) again]",
 "またたき": "رَمَشَ (to close and reopen both eyes quickly) / رَمْشَة (The act of quickly closing both eyes and opening them again.)  [blink (of eyes)]\nمثال: 彼女はまばたきして涙を止めようとした。\n→ She blinked to stop the tears. / لَأْلَأَ (To shine with a flickering light; to glimmer.)  [twinkling (of stars)]",
 "またたく": "لَأْلَأَ (To shine with a flickering light; to glimmer.)  [to twinkle (e.g. stars)]\nمثال: 星が空に瞬いていた。\n→ The stars were twinkling in the sky. / رَمَشَ (to close and reopen both eyes quickly) / رَمْشَة (The act of quickly closing both eyes and opening them again.)  [to blink (one's eyes)]\nまたたく is sometimes used transitively",
