 "まちなか": "وَسَطُ البَلَد (The main business part of a city or town, usually located at or near its center.)  [downtown]\nمثال: 町中で、珍しい物を見つけました。\n→ I found something interesting in the town.",
 "まちなみ": "شَارِع, زَنَقَة (A paved part of road, usually in a village or a town.)  [street (of stores and houses)]\nمثال: 異国情緒あふれる街並みが続く。\n→ The streets are filled with an air of exoticism.",
