 "まちぶせる": "كَمين (The act of concealing oneself and lying in wait to attack or kill by surprise.) / كَمِين (An attack launched from a concealed position.) / كَمِين (The troops posted in a concealed place, for attacking by surprise; those who lie)  [to ambush]\nمثال: 彼を待ち伏せる一計を案じた。\n→ He has a plan to ambush him.",
 "まちまち": "مُخْتَلِف, مُتَنَوَّع (Having a broad range (of different elements).)  [various]\nمثال: その件について彼らの意見はまちまちだ。\n→ Their views vary on the subject.",
