 "まちやくば": "بَلَدِيَّة (A building that houses the local government offices of a town.)  [town hall]",
 "まぢ": "جِدِّيّ (Without humor or expression of happiness; grave in manner or disposition.) / جَدِّيّ, جَادّ (Important; weighty; not insignificant.) / جَدِّيّ, جَادّ (Really intending what is said (or planned, etc); in earnest; not jocular or dece)  [serious]\nمثال: 「・・・おい・・・おい、先生！」「え？・・・あ、ああ」「マジだいじょうぶ？休講にしたら？」\n→ \"...Hey...Hey, teacher!\" \"Eh? Oh.\" \"Are you really OK? Shouldn't you cancel the lesson?\"",
 "まぢか": "قَرِيب (Physically close.) / قَرِيبًا (At or towards a position close in space or time.) / بِٱلْقُرْب مِنَ, عِنْدَ (Physically close to, in close proximity to.) / قَرُبَ (To come closer to; to approach.)  [near] / قَرِيب (Physically close.) / قَرِيبًا (At or towards a position close in space or time.) / بِٱلْقُرْب مِنَ, عِنْدَ (Physically close to, in close proximity to.) / قَرُبَ (To come closer to; to approach.)  [(drawing) near]\nمثال: この建物は完成間近だ。\n→ This building is near completion.",
 "まっか": "شطف (A sudden flowing; a rush which fills or overflows, as of water for cleansing pur)  [flushed (of face)]\nمثال: 真っ赤な夕焼けは明日の晴天を告げた。\n→ The deep red of the setting sun portended fine weather. / اِنْتَهَى, أَكْمَلَ (To finish; to make done; to reach the end.) / كَامِل (With all parts included; with nothing missing; full.) / ذَرِيع (Generic intensifier.)  [complete]\nمثال: そいつは真っ赤なうそだ。\n→ That's a blessed lie.",
