 "まっき": "اَلْعَامَ اَلْمَاضِيَ, اَلسَّنَةَ ٱلْمَاضِيَةَ  [last years]\nمثال: その物語の舞台は明治末期の日本である。\n→ The setting of the story is Japan in the late Meiji period.",
 "まっくろ": "فَحْمِيّ (Coal-black; the blackest black.)  [jet-black]\nمثال: あーあ、トーストが真っ黒に焦げてしまっているよ。\n→ Oh, the toast is burned black. / [strongly tanned ; deeply sunburnt] / [sooty ; black with dirt]",
 "まっこう": "بَخُور (material burnt for fragrant smoke) / بُخُور (material burnt for fragrant smoke)  [incense]",
 "まっこうから": "مُبَاشَرَةً (In a direct manner; in a straight line or course.)  [directly]\nمثال: 首相が政敵の挑戦と真っ向から対決しました。\n→ The prime minister directly confronted the challenges of his political opponents.",
 "まっこうくじら": "حُوتُ الْعَنْبَر (A whale, Physeter macrocephalus, the largest of the toothed whales.)  [sperm whale]\nمثال: マッコウクジラは、1,000メートルの深さまで潜ることができる。\n→ The sperm whale can dive to a depth of 1,000 meters.",
 "まっこと": "حَقًّا (Actually; in fact; in reality.) / وَٱللّٰه؟ (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / لَيْسَ مَعْقُل! (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / حَقًّا (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some )  [really]\nfrom 誠に",
 "まっさいちゅう": "فِي مُنْتَصَف, وَسْطَ (Among, in the middle of; amidst.)  [midst]\nمثال: 私はコンサートの真最中に劇場を出なければならなかった。\n→ I had to leave the theatre in the middle of the concert.",
 "まっさき": "رَئِيس, رَئِيسَة (The part of the body of an animal or human which contains the brain, mouth, and ) / رَئِيس (A leader or expert.) / اِتَّجَهَ (To move in a specified direction.)  [the head]\nمثال: あすの朝まっさきにそれを片付けます。\n→ I'll do that first thing in the morning.",
 "まっさきに": "أَوَّلًا, قَبْلَ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Firstly; before anything else.)  [first of all]",
 "まっさつ": "حذف (The act of eliminating, expelling or throwing off.)  [elimination (of a person, group, etc.)]\nمثال: なぜその政治家は大多数の意見を抹殺しようとするのか。\n→ Why is the politician trying to kill off the opinions of the majority? / رَدّ (An assertion of untruth.) / نَفْي (The negation in logic.) / إِنْكَار, رَفْض (A refusal or failure to provide or grant something that is requested or desired.)  [denial (of an opinion, fact, etc.)] / [erasure (of writing) ; rubbing out]",
 "まっさなか": "فِي مُنْتَصَف, وَسْطَ (Among, in the middle of; amidst.)  [midst]\nمثال: 私はコンサートの真最中に劇場を出なければならなかった。\n→ I had to leave the theatre in the middle of the concert.",
 "まっさら": "طَازَج, طَازَة (Newly produced or obtained; recent.) / عَذْب (Without salt; not saline.)  [fresh]",
 "まっしかく": "مُرَبَّع (A polygon with four straight sides of equal length and four right angles; an equ) / مُرَبَّع (Shaped like a square (the polygon).) / مُرَبَّع (Used in the names of units of area formed by multiplying a unit of length by its)  [square]",
 "まっしょう": "[tip of a twig] / طَرَف (extreme end of something) / بَقْشِيش (To give a small gratuity to, especially to an employee of someone who provides a) / بَقْشِيش, بَخْشِيش (A small monetary gift.) / إِخْبَارِيَّة (A piece of private or secret information, especially imparted by someone with ex) / نَصِيحَة (A piece of advice.)  [tip] / [trifles ; trivial matters]",
