 "まっしょうてき": "تافِه (Ignorable; of little significance or value.)  [trivial]",
 "まっしろ": "[pure white]\nمثال: 見渡す限り、野原は真っ白だった。\n→ The field was white as far as the eye could see. / خَالٍ, اَلْخَالِي (Free from writing, printing, or marks; having an empty space to be filled in.)  [blank (e.g. mind, paper)]",
 "まっすぐ": "مُسْتَقِيم (Not crooked, curly, or bent; having a constant direction throughout its length.) / عَلَى طُول (Of a direction relative to the subject, precisely; as if following a direct line)  [straight (ahead)]\nمثال: あなたはきのう放課後まっすぐ帰宅しましたか。\n→ Did you go straight home after school yesterday? / صَرِيح, مُسْتَقِيم (Direct; forthright; frank; sincere.)  [straightforward]",
