 "まったい": "اِنْتَهَى, أَكْمَلَ (To finish; to make done; to reach the end.) / كَامِل (With all parts included; with nothing missing; full.) / ذَرِيع (Generic intensifier.)  [complete] / أَمِين, سَالِم (Not in danger; out of harm's reach.) / خَزْنَة حَدِيدِيَّة, خَزْنَة (A box, usually made of metal, in which valuables can be locked for safekeeping.)  [safe]",
 "まったき": "كَمَال, إتقان (The quality or state of being perfect or complete, so that nothing substandard r)  [perfection]",
 "まったく": "حَقًّا (Actually; in fact; in reality.) / وَٱللّٰه؟ (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / لَيْسَ مَعْقُل! (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / حَقًّا (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some )  [really]\nمثال: 彼の意見は我々の意見とはまったく違っている。\n→ His opinion is quite different from ours. / [indeed]\nمثال: 「彼女はきれいだね」「まったくだ」\n→ \"She is lovely.\" \"So she is.\" / [good grief]",
 "まったくする": "أَدَّى (To finish successfully.)  [to accomplish]",
