 "まったくもって": "فِي الْحَقِيقَة (Actually, in fact.)  [as a matter of fact]\nmore emphatic than 全く",
 "まっただなか": "مُنْتَصَف, وَسَط (A centre, midpoint.) / وَسَط, مُتَوَسْط (Located in the middle; in between.)  [(right in the) middle]\nemphatic form of 只中\nمثال: 彼らは町の騒音の真っただ中にいる。\n→ They are amid the city noises. / فِي مُنْتَصَف, وَسْطَ (Among, in the middle of; amidst.)  [midst (e.g. of a storm)]\nemphatic form of 只中\nمثال: 僕らは青春の真っ只中だ。\n→ We are in the heyday of youth.",
 "まったり": "غَنِيّ (having wealth)  [rich (taste)] / اِسْتَرْخَى (To become loose.)  [relaxed]",
 "まったん": "نِهَايَة, غَايَة (The most extreme point of an object, especially one that is longer than it is wi) / غَايَة (A purpose, goal, or aim.) / اِنْتَهَى, أَنْهَى (To finish, terminate.)  [end] / [rank and file ; part of an organisation furthest from the centre]",
 "まったんしょうひしゃ": "مستخدم نهائي (The final consumer of a product; the intended recipient or user.)  [end user]",
 "まっちゃ": "مَاتْشَا (A type of powdered green tea, traditionally used in Japanese tea ceremonies.)  [matcha]",
 "まっとう": "مُحْتَرَم (Deserving respect.)  [respectable] / تَمَامًا (In a complete manner; thoroughly.)  [completely]",
 "まっとうする": "أَدَّى (To finish successfully.)  [to accomplish]\nمثال: 彼は天寿を全うした。\n→ He lived to a ripe old age.",
 "まっぱ": "فِرْقَة (religious movement) / مَذْهَب (religious movement) / طائِفَة (religious movement) / نِحْلَة (religious movement)  [sect]",
 "まっぱだか": "عُرْي (The state or quality of being without clothing on the body; specifically, the qu)  [nudity] / [stark naked]",
 "まっぴつながら": "أخيراً وليس آخراً (An expression to start the last item of a list, emphasising that while it is lis)  [last but not least]\nletter-closing phrase expressing regret for not mentioning something earlier in the letter",
 "まっ先": "رَئِيس, رَئِيسَة (The part of the body of an animal or human which contains the brain, mouth, and ) / رَئِيس (A leader or expert.) / اِتَّجَهَ (To move in a specified direction.)  [the head]\nمثال: あすの朝まっさきにそれを片付けます。\n→ I'll do that first thing in the morning.",
 "まっ先に": "أَوَّلًا, قَبْلَ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ (Firstly; before anything else.)  [first of all]",
 "まっ四角": "مُرَبَّع (A polygon with four straight sides of equal length and four right angles; an equ) / مُرَبَّع (Shaped like a square (the polygon).) / مُرَبَّع (Used in the names of units of area formed by multiplying a unit of length by its)  [square]",
 "まっ白": "[pure white]\nمثال: 見渡す限り、野原は真っ白だった。\n→ The field was white as far as the eye could see. / خَالٍ, اَلْخَالِي (Free from writing, printing, or marks; having an empty space to be filled in.)  [blank (e.g. mind, paper)]",
 "まっ裸": "عُرْي (The state or quality of being without clothing on the body; specifically, the qu)  [nudity] / [stark naked]",
 "まっ赤": "شطف (A sudden flowing; a rush which fills or overflows, as of water for cleansing pur)  [flushed (of face)]\nمثال: 真っ赤な夕焼けは明日の晴天を告げた。\n→ The deep red of the setting sun portended fine weather. / اِنْتَهَى, أَكْمَلَ (To finish; to make done; to reach the end.) / كَامِل (With all parts included; with nothing missing; full.) / ذَرِيع (Generic intensifier.)  [complete]\nمثال: そいつは真っ赤なうそだ。\n→ That's a blessed lie.",
 "まっ赤っ赤": "[very bright red ; deep red] / اِنْتَهَى, أَكْمَلَ (To finish; to make done; to reach the end.) / كَامِل (With all parts included; with nothing missing; full.) / ذَرِيع (Generic intensifier.)  [complete]",
 "まつ": "اِنْتَظَرَ (To delay movement or action until some event or time; to remain neglected or in )  [to wait]\nمثال: しばらく電話を切らずにお待ちください。\n→ Please hold the line a moment. / اِنْتَظَرَ, اِسْتَأْنَى (To wait for.)  [to await] / حَاجَة, ضَرُورَة (A requirement for something; something needed.) / اِحْتَاجَ (To have an absolute requirement for.) / اِحْتَاجَ (To want strongly; to feel that one must have something.)  [to need]\nusu. in negative form",
 "まつえ": "مَاتْسُوي (The capital city of Shimane Prefecture, Japan.)  [Matsue (city in Shimane)]",
 "まつえい": "سَلِيل (One of the progeny of a specified person, at any distance of time or through any)  [descendant]",
 "まつかえ": "[evergreen tree ; conifer] / [pine and cypress] / وَاجِب, وَظِيفَة (That which one is morally or legally obligated to do.) / رَسْم (An excise tax; especially, one on imports or exports.)  [duty]",
 "まつかさ": "كُوز الصَنَوْبَر (A conical seed-bearing structure produced on a pine tree.)  [pinecone]\nمثال: 例えばジャック・パインの松かさは、高温により影響を受けるまでは自ら開いて種子を放出しない。\n→ The cones of the jack pine, for example, do not readily open to release their seeds until they have been subjected to great heat.",
