 "まつぞう": "[degenerate age ; corrupt world] / نِهَايَة, غَايَة (The most extreme point of an object, especially one that is longer than it is wi) / غَايَة (A purpose, goal, or aim.) / اِنْتَهَى, أَنْهَى (To finish, terminate.)  [end]",
 "まつだい": "أَبَد (Existence without end, infinite time.) / أبَدِيَّة (A period of time which extends infinitely far into the future.)  [eternity]",
 "まつだいまで": "إِلَى الْأَبَد (For all time, for all eternity; for a lifetime; for an infinite amount of time.)  [forever]",
 "まつのは": "[pine needle] / تَذْكار (An item of sentimental value, that is given or kept to remember an event or loca)  [souvenir]",
 "まつのみ": "حَبّ صَنَوْبَر (The edible seed of any of several species of evergreen pine, especially Pinus pi)  [pine nut]",
 "まつばづえ": "عُكَّاز, عُكَّازَة (A device to assist in motion as a cane, especially one that provides support und)  [crutch]\nمثال: 彼は足の骨を折った時、３ヶ月間松葉杖を使わなければならなかった。\n→ When he broke his leg, he had to use crutches for 3 months.",
 "まつび": "نِهَايَة, غَايَة (The most extreme point of an object, especially one that is longer than it is wi) / غَايَة (A purpose, goal, or aim.) / اِنْتَهَى, أَنْهَى (To finish, terminate.)  [end (e.g. of report, document, paragraph, etc.)]",
 "まつぼっくり": "كُوز الصَنَوْبَر (A conical seed-bearing structure produced on a pine tree.)  [pinecone]",
 "まつぽっくり": "كُوز الصَنَوْبَر (A conical seed-bearing structure produced on a pine tree.)  [pinecone]",
 "まつやに": "رَاتِينَج, صُرْع (A viscous water-insoluble hydrocarbon exudate of certain plants, or such a subst)  [(pine) resin]",
 "まつやま": "مَاتْسُويَامَا (The capital city of Ehime Prefecture, Japan.)  [Matsuyama (city in Ehime)]",
 "まつよう": "نِهَايَة, غَايَة (The most extreme point of an object, especially one that is longer than it is wi) / غَايَة (A purpose, goal, or aim.) / اِنْتَهَى, أَنْهَى (To finish, terminate.)  [end (of an era, century)] / سَلِيل (One of the progeny of a specified person, at any distance of time or through any)  [descendant]",
 "まつり": "عِيد, مَهْرَجَان (An event or series of special events centred on the celebration or promotion of )  [festival]\nمثال: その祭りはつまらないどころではありませんでした。\n→ The festival was far from dull. / لَهَب, شُعْلَة (The visible part of fire; a stream of burning vapour or gas, emitting light and )  [flaming] / [galore (as in \"goals galore\") ; frenzy]",
 "まつりあげる": "[to set (someone) up (in a high position) ; to kick upstairs]\nمثال: 彼はジョンを閑職に祭り上げた。\n→ He kicked John upstairs. / عِبَادَة (The devotion accorded to a deity or to a sacred object.) / عَبَدَ, سَجَدَ (To reverence (a deity, etc.) with supreme respect and veneration; to perform rel) / سَجَدَ (To participate in religious ceremonies.)  [to worship] / تَمَلَّقَ, تَبَصْبَصَ (To compliment someone, often (but not necessarily) insincerely and sometimes to )  [to flatter]",
 "まつりか": "فُلّ (A shrubby vine with flowers whose fragrance is used for perfume and flavoring (J)  [Arabian jasmine (Jasminum sambac)]",
 "まつりごと": "قَانُون, قَاعِدَة (A regulation, law, guideline.) / حُكْم, حُكُومَة (The act of ruling; administration of law; government; empire; authority; control) / حَكَمَ (To regulate, be in charge of, make decisions for, reign over.)  [rule]",
 "まつりゅう": "سَلِيل (One of the progeny of a specified person, at any distance of time or through any)  [descendants]",
 "まつる": "أَلَّهَ (To make into a god.)  [to deify]\nمثال: この記念碑は祖国に命を捧げた兵士を祭っている。\n→ This monument is dedicated to the soldiers who gave their lives to their country. / صَلَّى, دَعَا (To direct words, thoughts, or one's attention to a deity or any higher being, fo)  [to pray]",
 "まつろ": "النِهاية (Used traditionally at the end of a story or film.)  [the end]",
 "まつろわぬ": "عَاصٍ (Not obedient.)  [disobedient]",
 "まつわりつく": "تَمَسَّكَ (To hold very tightly, as to not fall off.)  [to cling (to)]\nمثال: その猫は彼女の着物にまつわりついた。\n→ The cat clung to her dress. / [to follow around ; to hang around]\nمثال: 見たこともないような数の虻が、私にまとわりついてきたのです。\n→ More horseflies than I'd ever seen came and flew around me.",
 "まつわる": "[to coil around ; to follow about] / خَصَّ (To relate or belong to; to have reference to or connection with; to affect the i) / هَمَّ (To make somebody worried.)  [to concern]",
 "まつ毛": "رِمْش, هُدْب (One of the hairs which grows along the edge of eyelids.)  [eyelashes]",
 "まてき": "أَخَّاذ (Very beautiful or attractive.)  [captivating] / [demonic ; devilish]",
 "まてんろう": "نَاطِحَة سَحَاب (A very tall building with a large number of floors.)  [skyscraper]\nمثال: その摩天楼はまわりの他の建物の上方にそびえていた。\n→ The skyscraper rose above the other buildings around.",
 "まで": "حَتَّى (Before (a time).) / حَتَّى, إِلَى أَنْ (Up to the time that (a condition becomes true).) / حَتَّى (Before (a condition becoming true).)  [until (a time)]\nمثال: １０時までに夕食の準備をしておくように取り計らいなさい。\n→ See that dinner is ready by ten. / أَنّ (A particle used for marking the following verb as an infinitive.) / إِلَى, عَلَى (Indicating destination or final position: In the direction of, so as to arrive a)  [to (a place or person)] / أَنّ (A particle used for marking the following verb as an infinitive.) / إِلَى, عَلَى (Indicating destination or final position: In the direction of, so as to arrive a)  [to (an extent)] / وَحِيد (1. alone in a category) / فَقَط (Without others or anything further; exclusively.) / فَقَط (No more than; just.) / فَقَط (Introduces a clause with negative polarity, often one which upsets the listener')  [only]",
 "までに": "بِجَانِب, جنب (Near or next to.) / عِنْدَ, فِي (Not later than (the given time); not later than the end of (the given time inter) / مِن قِبَل, بِوَاسِطَّة (Indicates the person or thing that does or causes something: Through the action ) / بِوَاسِطَّة, لِـ (Indicates the creator of a work: Existing through the authorship etc. of.)  [by]\nمثال: 昭和天皇が靖国神社で７５年までに戦後計８回参拝した。\n→ In the post-War period, up until 1975, Emperor Showa prayed at the Yasukuni Shrine a total of 8 times.",
 "までも": "أَنّ (A particle used for marking the following verb as an infinitive.) / إِلَى, عَلَى (Indicating destination or final position: In the direction of, so as to arrive a)  [to (an extent)]\nmore emphatic than まで / [there is no need to ... ; it should hardly be necessary to ...]\nas ...までもない / [even if there is no need to ... (at least ...)]\nas ...ないまでも",
 "まと": "دَرَجَة (Score, grade, or related judgement.) / أَشَّرَ (To indicate (something) in writing or by other symbols.)  [mark]\nمثال: 私は矢を的に当てた。\n→ I hit the mark with the arrow. / عُرْضَة, شَيْء (A thing that has physical existence but is not alive.) / هَدَف (Objective; goal, end or purpose of something.) / مَفْعُول بِهِ, مَفْعُول (The noun phrase which is an internal complement of a verb phrase or a prepositio) / كَائِن (An instantiation of a class or structure.)  [object] / نُقْطَة (A small dot or mark.) / نُقْطَة (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / مَوْقِع (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / أَشَارَ (To extend the index finger in the direction of something in order to show where )  [point (e.g. of argument)]",
 "まとう": "لَبِسَ, اِرْتَدَى (To don (clothing, equipment, or the like).)  [to put on]\nمثال: その未亡人は黒衣をまとっていた。\n→ The widow was dressed in black.",
 "まとうだい": "ضوري مذهب (An edible marine fish (Zeus faber or Zeus ocellata), having long dorsal spines.)  [John Dory (Zeus faber)]",
 "まとはずれ": "عَرَضِيّ (not related, not applicable, unimportant, not connected)  [irrelevant]\nمثال: 彼の言ったことは的はずれだった。\n→ What he said was beside the point.",
 "まとば": "مدى, قدرة (The maximum distance or reach of capability (of a weapon, radio, detector, etc.)) / مَدَى (The length of the smallest interval which contains all the data in a sample; the)  [range (e.g. rifle, firing)]",
 "まとまった": "كَبِير, وَاسِع (Of considerable or relatively great size or extent.)  [large] / مَعْرِفَة (Designating an identified or immediately identifiable person or thing, or group )  [definite]",
 "まとまり": "وَحْدَة, اِتِّحَاد (Oneness: the state or fact of being one undivided entity.)  [unity]\nمثال: この組織はまとまりに欠けている。\n→ This organization lacks unity. / مُسْتَعْمَرَة, مُسْتَوْطَنَة (A colony that is newly established; a place or region newly settled.)  [settlement]",
