 "まとめあげる": "تجميع (To make by gathering pieces from various sources.)  [to compile]",
 "まとめやく": "صانِعُ ٱلسَّلام, مُصْلِح (A person who restores peace, especially by settling disputes; one who engages in)  [peacemaker]",
 "まとめる": "جَمَعَ (To gather together; amass.)  [to collect]\nمثال: データはまだまとめていません。\n→ The data hasn't been compiled yet. / لَخَّصَ, اِخْتَصَرَ (To prepare a summary of (something).)  [to summarize] / أَنْهَى (To make final or firm; to finish or complete.)  [to finalize] / قَرَّرَ, صَمَّمَ (To resolve (a contest, problem, dispute, etc.); to choose, determine, or settle.) / قَرَّرَ (To make a judgment, especially after deliberation.)  [to decide]",
 "まとめ上げる": "تجميع (To make by gathering pieces from various sources.)  [to compile]",
 "まとめ役": "صانِعُ ٱلسَّلام, مُصْلِح (A person who restores peace, especially by settling disputes; one who engages in)  [peacemaker]",
 "まとも": "جَبْهَة (An area where armies are engaged in conflict, especially the line of contact.) / أَمَامِيّ (Located at or near the front.)  [the front]\nusu. adverbially as 〜に / نَزِيه, صَادِق (Scrupulous with regard to telling the truth; not given to swindling, lying, or f)  [honest]\nمثال: まともな仕事につかなければいけませんよ。\n→ You've got to get a steady job.",
 "まともに": "يَمِين, يمين (Clockwise, particularly when describing a change in direction or orientation.) / صَحِيح, صَوَاب (Complying with justice, correctness, or reason; correct, just, true. See also th) / قَائِم (Of an angle, measuring 90 degrees, or one quarter of a complete rotation; the an) / عَلَى اَلْيَمِين (On the right side.) / إِلَى اَلْيَمِين (Towards the right side.) / صحيح, تمام (Yes, that is correct; I agree.) / حَقّ, حُقُوق (A legal, just or moral entitlement.) / يَمِين (A wave breaking from right to left (viewed from the shore).) / صَحَّحَ (To correct.)  [right (in front)]\nمثال: 太陽がまともに照り付けている。\n→ The sun is shining in my face. / كَمَا يَجِب, كَمَا يَنْبَغِي (In a proper manner, appropriately, suitably; correctly, justifiably)  [properly]\nمثال: 偏屈な奴とまともに話し合っても無駄だ。\n→ It is useless to reason with a bigot. / بِصَراحة (In an honest manner.)  [honestly]",
 "まとわりつく": "تَمَسَّكَ (To hold very tightly, as to not fall off.)  [to cling (to)]\nمثال: その猫は彼女の着物にまつわりついた。\n→ The cat clung to her dress. / [to follow around ; to hang around]\nمثال: 見たこともないような数の虻が、私にまとわりついてきたのです。\n→ More horseflies than I'd ever seen came and flew around me.",
 "まとをしぼる": "بُؤْرَة (Concentration of attention.)  [to focus]\nمثال: 上手な弁護士はひとつの鍵となる証拠に的を絞る。\n→ A good lawyer will always zero in on a key piece of evidence.",
 "まど": "نَافِذَة, شُبَّاك (An opening, usually covered by one or more panes of clear glass, to allow light ) / نَافِذَة, ويندو (A rectangular area on a computer terminal or screen containing some kind of user)  [window]\nمثال: 窓を開けっぱなしにしておいたの？\n→ Did you leave the window open?",
 "まどい": "خِدَاع, ضَلَالَة (The state of being deluded or misled, or process of deluding somebody.) / غَرُور (That which is falsely or delusively believed or propagated; false belief; error )  [delusion]",
 "まどう": "هَرْطَقَة, بِدْعَة (A doctrine held by a member of a religion at variance or conflict with establish)  [heresy] / سِحْر (Magical power; the use of witchcraft or magic arts.)  [sorcery] / [netherworld ; world outside the six realms where evil spirits roam]",
 "まどうし": "سَاحِر (A magician or wizard. Sometimes specifically male.)  [sorcerer]\nمثال: 魔術師サラ。人は彼女を『大魔導師』とか呼ぶらしい。\n→ The magician Sarah. Apparently people call her \"The Great Mage\" or some such.",
 "まどか": "مُسْتَدِير, مُدَوَّر (Of shape:) / مُسْتَدِير, كُرَوِيّ (Of shape:) / دَائِرَة (A circular or spherical object or part of an object.) / جَوْلَة, مَرْحَلَة (One of the specified pre-determined segments of the total time of a sport event,) / دَوْرَة (A stage, level, set of events in a game)  [round] / [tranquil ; contentedly at ease]",
