 "まま": "كَـ, مِثْل (To such an extent or degree; to the same extent or degree.) / مِثْل, كَـ (Introducing a basis of comparison, with an object in the objective case.)  [as (it is)]\nمثال: 町は昔のままだった。\n→ The town was exactly the same as before. / مَعَ (In the company of; alongside, close to; near to.) / بِـ (In addition to; as an accessory to.) / بِـ (Using as an instrument; by means of.)  [with (e.g. one's eyes closed, the light on)]\nafter a past-tense verb describing a state\nمثال: 窓を開けたまま寝るな。\n→ Don't sleep with the windows open. / كَـ, مِثْل (To such an extent or degree; to the same extent or degree.) / مِثْل, كَـ (Introducing a basis of comparison, with an object in the objective case.)  [as (one pleases, one is told, etc.)]\nas 〜に\nمثال: 足の向くままに歩いた。\n→ We let our legs do the leading.",
