 "ままはは": "زَوْجَةُ الْأَب (wife of one's biological father, not one's biological mother) / رَابَّة (wife of one's biological father, not one's biological mother)  [stepmother]\nمثال: 継母は彼女に辛く当たった。\n→ The stepmother was hard on her.",
