 "まゆをよせる": "عُبُوسة, عُبُوس (A wrinkling of the forehead with the eyebrows brought together, typically indica) / عَبَسَ, عَقَدَ حَاجِبَيْهُ (To have a frown on one's face.)  [to frown]\nمثال: 笑いで誤魔化すと、亜美さんはさも不機嫌そうに眉を寄せた。\n→ Ami frowned in a very un-amused way as I brushed her off with a laugh.",
