 "まるっこい": "مُسْتَدِير, مُدَوَّر (Of shape:) / مُسْتَدِير, كُرَوِيّ (Of shape:) / دَائِرَة (A circular or spherical object or part of an object.) / جَوْلَة, مَرْحَلَة (One of the specified pre-determined segments of the total time of a sport event,) / دَوْرَة (A stage, level, set of events in a game)  [round]",
