 "みのない": "بدون جدوى (Having no purpose; purposeless; unable to effect an aim.)  [pointless]\nمثال: もうよろしくてよ。実のない会話にはうんざりですわ。\n→ That is enough. I have had it with fruitless conversation.",
 "みのほどしらず": "أَنَافَ (to reach above or beyond, especially to an excessive degree) / غَلَا (to reach above or beyond, especially to an excessive degree) / نَيَّفَ (to reach above or beyond, especially to an excessive degree) / تَطَاوَلَ (to reach above or beyond, especially to an excessive degree)  [overreaching]",
 "みのり": "يَنَعَ, نَضَجَ (Of grain, fruit, flowers, etc., to grow ripe; to become mature.)  [ripening (of a crop)] / مَحْصُول (The production amount of such an output for a specific season or year, particula) / حَوْصَلة (A pouch-like part of the alimentary tract of some birds (and some other animals))  [crop]\nمثال: ドイツに滞在した１年間は非常に実りの多いものだった。\n→ Their stay in Germany for a year was very fruitful.",
 "みのりある": "مُكَافَأَة, ثَوَاب (Something of value given in return for an act.) / جَائِزَة (A prize promised for a certain deed or catch) / جَزَاء (The result of an action, whether good or bad.) / مَنَحَ (To give a reward to or for.)  [rewarding]\nمثال: 幸せで実りある新年を迎えられますように。\n→ Best wishes for a happy and prosperous New Year.",
