 "も": "حِدَاد (Specifically, the act of expressing or feeling sorrow regarding a death or loss.) / ثَوْبُ حِدَاد (The traditional clothes worn by those who mourn (in Western societies, typically)  [mourning] / بَلَاء, بُؤْس (An event resulting in great loss.)  [calamity]",
 "もいちど": "مَرَّة أُخْرَى (Another time: indicating a repeat of an action.)  [again]\nمثال: この番号にもう一度かけてみていただけますか。\n→ Can you try this number again?",
 "もう": "قَد, مِنْ قَبْلُ (Prior to some specified time, either past, present, or future; by this time; pre) / لقد (So soon.)  [already]\nمثال: 彼はもう帰宅しました。\n→ He has already gone home. / قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon]\nمثال: もうそろそろ帰る時間だ。\n→ It is about time we were leaving. / أَبْعَد, أَقْصَى (More distant; relatively distant.)  [further]\nمثال: 一方は背が高く、もう一方は背が低い。\n→ One is tall and the other is short. / غِي, جِي (The name of the Latin script letter G/g.)  [gee]\nused to strengthen expression of an emotion (often exasperation)\nمثال: もう〜、なにやってんだよ。\n→ Jeez, what're you up to?",
 "もうあく": "مُتَوَحِّش (Wild; not cultivated or tamed.) / هَمَجِيّ (Barbaric; not civilized.) / مُتَوَحِّش, هَمَجِيّ (An aggressively defiant person.)  [savage]",
