 "もうしいれる": "اِقْتَرَحَ (To suggest a plan, course of action, etc.) / خَطَبَ, طَلَبَ يَد (To ask for a person's hand in marriage.)  [to propose]\nمثال: 同じ頃、事務員・有村夏恵は、今月を限りに退職する旨を五鬼上に申し入れた。\n→ At the same time, the clerk Natsue Arimura told Gokijo of her intent to resign after this month.",
 "もうしうける": "سَأَلَ, طَلَبَ (To request; to order.)  [to ask for (e.g. a fee)]\nمثال: 別にサービス料を申し受けます。\n→ The service charge is extra. / قَبِلَ (To receive, especially with a consent, with favour, or with approval.) / اِعْتَرَفَ (To admit to a place or a group.) / قَبِلَ (To receive or admit to; to agree to; to assent to; to submit to.)  [to accept (e.g. orders)]",
