 "もうしご": "[heaven-sent child (in answer to a Shinto or Buddhist prayer)] / وَلَد, اِبْن (One's direct descendant by birth, regardless of age; one's offspring; a son or d)  [child (e.g. of an era)]\nusu. as ～の申し子",
 "もうしそえる": "جَمَعَ (To sum up; to put together mentally; to add up.) / أَضَافَ (To append (e.g. a statement); to say further information.) / أَضَافَ (To intensify; to augment; to increase.) / أَضَافَ (To add someone as a friend.)  [to add (to what was said before)]",
 "もうしたて": "تَصْرِيح, بَيَان (A declaration or remark.)  [statement]\nمثال: 私の申し立ては本当だと彼は発表した。\n→ He announced my statement to be true.",
