 "もじかん": "أَثَر (A mark left by something that has passed along.) / مِضْمَار (A path or course laid out for a race, for exercise, etc.)  [tracking]\nمثال: ああそうそう、コメント欄のバグは文字間を調節するletter-spacingタグを使うと起こるものだったみたい。\n→ Oh, while I remember, it seems that that was a bug that occurs when you use the comment field's 'letter-spacing' tag which adjusts the…",
