 "もす": "حَرْق (physical injury) / سَفْعَة (physical injury) / حُرق (physical injury) / أَحْرَقَ (to cause to be consumed by fire) / حَرَقَ (to cause to be consumed by fire) / ضَرِمَ (to cause to be consumed by fire) / حرق (to cause to be consumed by fire) / حرق (to cause to be consumed by fire) / وَلَّع (to cause to be consumed by fire)  [to burn]\nمثال: このガラクタは火に燃やしなさい。\n→ Burn this rubbish on the fire. / [to burn with (emotion, feeling) ; to be fired up]\nمثال: 彼女は嫉妬の炎を燃やした。\n→ She burned with jealousy.",
