 "もちかえる": "أَخْرَجَ (To remove.)  [to take out (e.g. food)]\nمثال: ミツバチは、においのサンプルを巣に持ち帰ることによって食糧のありかを伝える。\n→ Bees communicate the location of food by carrying odor samples back to the hive.",
 "もちかける": "اِقْتِرَاح (A proposal that has been made.) / اِقْتَرَحَ, قَدَّمَ (To propose or express one's willingness (to do something).) / قَدَّمَ (To present (something) to God or gods, as a gesture of worship or as a sacrifice)  [to offer (a suggestion, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼は金を借りようとおじに話をもちかけた。\n→ He approached his uncle about lending him some money.",
