 "もちこし": "[work, items, etc. carried over from earlier]\nمثال: ドタキャンくらったの。来週に持ち越しだって。\n→ Got cancelled at the last minute. 'Deferred to next week'. / خُمَار (negative effects caused by heavy drinking) / خُمَار اَلسُّكْر (negative effects caused by heavy drinking) / صُدَاع الخَمْر (negative effects caused by heavy drinking)  [hangover]",
 "もちこす": "أَجَّلَ (To delay or put off an event, appointment, etc.)  [to postpone]\nمثال: 仕事は金曜日の１１時に終わらなかったので、次の月曜日に持ち越すことにした。\n→ The work wasn't finished at 11:00 p.m. Friday, so they decided to carry it over to the following Monday.",
 "もちこたえる": "قَاوَمَ (To resist or endure (something) successfully.)  [to withstand]\nمثال: その病人がどれだけ持ちこたえるかは、誰にもわからない。\n→ Nobody knows how long the sick man can hold on.",
 "もちこむ": "[to bring in ; to take in]\nمثال: これは機内に持ち込めますか。\n→ Can I carry this on the plane? / أَحْضَرَ, جَاءَ بِـ (To transport toward somebody/somewhere.)  [to bring] / أَحْضَرَ, جَاءَ بِـ (To transport toward somebody/somewhere.)  [to bring (to another stage)]\nمثال: 私は妥協を許さずに希望していた通りの契約に持ち込んだ。\n→ I stood my ground and got the contract I wanted.",
 "もちだか": "مَوْقِع, مَكَان (A place or location.) / مَنْصِب (A post of employment; a job.) / مَكَانَة, رُتْبَة (A status or rank.) / رَأْي, مَوْقِف (An opinion, stand, or stance.) / جِلْسَة, وَقْفَة (A posture.)  [position]",
